  "runs_with_load_what": "после последовательности (as_of None, затем 2025-07-01) — 205 первых dev-запросов (с ОКПД2, as_of=None, limit=20), как их шлёт make latency, по HTTP; after_205_dev_queries — RSS после них",
  "probe": "scripts of the probe are not in the repository (path is outside of the task); source below",
  "probe_source": "\"\"\"RSS of a real uvicorn process serving src.api.app on the first queries WITHOUT OKPD2 (#81, review #65).\n\nusage: rss_probe.py <store parquet|postgres> <cold|prebuilt> <seq: none|cutoff|both> [<out.json>]\ncold: doc_codes.parquet of the indexes is removed first (built by the first query without OKPD2).\n\"\"\"\nimport json, os, shutil, subprocess, sys, tempfile, time, urllib.request\n\nWT = os.environ[\"WT\"]\nstore, codes, seq = sys.argv[1:4]\nsrc_idx = os.environ[\"INDEX_DIR\"]\nwork = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"rssprobe-\", dir=os.environ.get(\"PROBE_TMP\"))\nidx = os.path.join(work, \"indexes\")\nshutil.copytree(src_idx, idx)\ntmp = os.path.join(work, \"tmp\"); os.makedirs(tmp)\nif codes == \"cold\":\n    for d in os.listdir(idx):\n        p = os.path.join(idx, d, \"doc_codes.parquet\")\n        if os.path.exists(p):\n            os.remove(p)\nport = 8790 + abs(hash((store, codes, seq))) % 100\nenv = dict(os.environ, DATA_STORE=store, INDEX_DIR=idx, TMPDIR=tmp)\nproc = subprocess.Popen([f\"{WT}/.venv/bin/python\", \"-m\", \"uvicorn\", \"src.api.app:app\", \"--port\", str(port),\n                         \"--log-level\", \"warning\"], cwd=WT, env=env)\n\ndef mem(pid):\n    out = {}\n    for line in open(f\"/proc/{pid}/status\"):\n        if line.startswith((\"VmRSS\", \"VmHWM\")):\n            k, v = line.split(\":\"); out[k] = round(int(v.split()[0]) / 1024, 1)\n    return {\"rss_mb\": out[\"VmRSS\"], \"peak_mb\": out[\"VmHWM\"]}\n\ndef call(path, body=None):\n    req = urllib.request.Request(f\"http://127.0.0.1:{port}{path}\", data=json.dumps(body).encode() if body else None,\n                                 headers={\"content-type\": \"application/json\"})\n    t0 = time.perf_counter()\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=600) as r:\n        data = r.read(); h = {k.lower(): v for k, v in r.headers.items()}\n    return (time.perf_counter() - t0) * 1000, data, h\n\ntry:\n    for _ in range(120):\n        try:\n            call(\"/api/health\"); break\n        except Exception:\n            time.sleep(0.5)\n    rec = {\"store\": store, \"codes\": codes, \"seq\": seq, \"after_start\": mem(proc.pid), \"steps\": []}\n    plan = {\"none\": [None], \"cutoff\": [\"2025-07-01\"], \"both\": [None, \"2025-07-01\"]}[seq]\n    texts = [\"бумага офисная А4\", \"перчатки нитриловые смотровые\"]\n    for as_of in plan:\n        for i, text in enumerate(texts):\n            q = {\"query_id\": f\"probe-{as_of}-{i}\", \"text\": text, \"as_of\": as_of}\n            ms, data, h = call(\"/api/search?limit=20\", q)\n            rec[\"steps\"].append({\"as_of\": as_of, \"text\": text, \"first_for_as_of\": i == 0, \"ms\": round(ms),\n                                 \"total_history\": int(h.get(\"x-total-history\", -1)), **mem(proc.pid)})\n    if len(sys.argv) > 4 and sys.argv[4] == \"load\":  # 205 dev queries over HTTP, as `make latency` sends them\n        cases = [json.loads(l)[\"query\"] for l in open(f\"{WT}/eval/cases/dev.jsonl\", encoding=\"utf-8\")][:205]\n        for q in cases:\n            call(\"/api/search?limit=20\", {**q, \"as_of\": None})\n        rec[\"after_205_dev_queries\"] = mem(proc.pid)\n    print(json.dumps(rec, ensure_ascii=False))\nfinally:\n    proc.terminate(); proc.wait(timeout=30)\n    shutil.rmtree(work, ignore_errors=True)\n",
  "make_latency_process": {
    "what": "пик (VmHWM) и RSS после прогона процесса `make latency` (TestClient и приложение в одном процессе, 200+5 dev-запросов, as_of=None; обёртка вызывает src.eval.latency.main и читает /proc/self/status). Снято при фоновой нагрузке (параллельный eval), на commit 5232e4c; память от нагрузки не зависит.",
